2245
02:20:04,697 --> 02:20:08,608
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: biometric-driven kind of border control, Your Honor.

2246
02:20:08,930 --> 02:20:14,574
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The concept really is to extend our borders beyond the actual physical border of the Philippines.

2247
02:20:15,381 --> 02:20:26,468
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We plan to institute a system wherein even if a passenger is in another country and is not qualified to enter the Philippines,

2248
02:20:26,468 --> 02:20:31,588
